    "body": "What:\nSafari's cookie banner button is clipped\n\n![Screen Shot 2020-08-27 at 12.12.45 PM.png](https://images.zenhubusercontent.com/5ebed8780d2d150fc281ad55/e0dd87c3-273a-4ff4-a18b-da5cebda50c4)\n\nHow:\nMake the experience as close to Chrome and Firefox as possible 🙏\n\n![Screen Shot 2020-08-27 at 12.13.42 PM.png](https://images.zenhubusercontent.com/5ebed8780d2d150fc281ad55/e7ee0a4d-d006-4ac4-b11e-bf7ef38241a1)\n\nTEAM COMMENTS:\n1. Timmy: At first glance, it feels like Safari has more spacing between the words, which could be the reason some chars get pushed to the second line. We can fix this by either allowing a more flexible button width or restrict word spacing. Personally feels like the former solution is easier than the latter 😆",
